title: Anti-Fascist Faction Splits
new-page: true
subtitle: The Anti-Fascist faction leaves, declaring the party has failed to confront the Nazi threat.
tags: event
view-if: anti_fascist_dissent >= 60 and anti_fascist_available and not anti_fascists_left and z_anti_fascist_split_timer = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.anti_fascists_left = 1;
Q.z_anti_fascist_split_timer = 4;

if (Q.anti_fascist_strength < 10) {
    Q.workers_z -= 2;
    Q.new_middle_z -= 2;
    Q.workers_kpd += 2;
    Q.new_middle_spd += 2;
    Q.unemployed_spd += 2;
} else if (Q.anti_fascist_strength < 25) {
    Q.workers_z -= 3;
    Q.new_middle_z -= 3;
    Q.unemployed_z -= 2;
    Q.workers_kpd += 3;
    Q.new_middle_spd += 3;
    Q.unemployed_spd += 3;
    Q.old_middle_spd += 2;
} else if (Q.anti_fascist_strength < 40) {
    Q.workers_z -= 4;
    Q.new_middle_z -= 4;
    Q.unemployed_z -= 3;
    Q.rural_z -= 2;
    Q.workers_kpd += 4;
    Q.new_middle_spd += 4;
    Q.unemployed_spd += 4;
    Q.old_middle_spd += 3;
} else if (Q.anti_fascist_strength < 60) {
    Q.workers_z -= 5;
    Q.new_middle_z -= 5;
    Q.unemployed_z -= 4;
    Q.rural_z -= 3;
    Q.workers_kpd += 5;
    Q.new_middle_spd += 5;
    Q.unemployed_spd += 5;
    Q.old_middle_spd += 4;
} else {
    Q.workers_z -= 6;
    Q.new_middle_z -= 6;
    Q.unemployed_z -= 5;
    Q.rural_z -= 4;
    Q.workers_kpd += 6;
    Q.new_middle_spd += 6;
    Q.unemployed_spd += 6;
    Q.old_middle_spd += 5;
}

Q.kpd_relation += 10;
Q.spd_relation += 5;
Q.bvp_relations -= 10;
if (Q.bvp_relations < 0) Q.bvp_relations = 0;
Q.z_relation -= 15;
Q.presidential_opinion -= 5;
if (Q.presidential_opinion < 0) Q.presidential_opinion = 0;

Q.anti_fascist_strength = Q.anti_fascist_strength * 0.3;
Q.anti_fascist_available = 0;

Q.n_advisors_start = Q.n_advisors;
if (Q.moenius_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1;
Q.moenius_advisor = 0;
if (Q.hundhammer_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1;
Q.hundhammer_advisor = 0;
if (Q.klausener_advisor == 1) Q.n_advisors -= 1;
Q.klausener_advisor = 0;
if (Q.n_advisors < Q.n_advisors_start) Q.shuffle_leadership_timer = 0;
!}
max-visits: 1

= Anti-Fascist faction leaves the party

The Anti-Fascist faction, led by Moenius, Hundhammer, and Klausener, has abandoned the party in despair. They declare that the Zentrum has proven incapable of mounting a genuine resistance to Nazism — whether through coalition compromises, presidential tolerance, or electoral caution. Many defect to the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> or <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>, while others join the <span style="color: #006400;">Iron Front</span> directly.

This is a devastating blow to the party's democratic credibility. Hindenburg views the departure of the most ardent republicans as confirmation that the Zentrum is no longer a reliable bulwark.